==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

